Calculate the difference between 963 and 389.

\subsection*{Answers}
The difference is 574.

Write the plural of the following nouns:  
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Actriz
    \item Pantalones
    \item Camión
    \item Pez
    \item Jueves
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Actrices
\item Pantalones
\item Camiones
\item Peces
\item Jueves
\end{enumerate}
